{"id":"n40855-2-7","stage":4,"title":"날아들다 · 飞过来","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40855-2-7-1","ko":"야구 게임은 재미있었어?","zh":"棒球游戏好玩吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야구","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}},{"text":"게임은","meaning":"比赛","explanation":"게임：比赛；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"2","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게임은","audio":"/audio/d9cf83882979e4b0cbec.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있었어?","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있었어","audio":"/audio/3fa0cdeed202a157bbd3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7403c43735a4108c","term":"야구","zh":"棒球","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3","entryId":"62512","definition":"各由九名队员组成的两队轮流攻守，用棍子击打对方选手投出的球并绕竞技场一周即可得分的比赛。","pronunciation":["야ː구"]},{"id":"252ac990d27ebe08","term":"게임","zh":"比赛","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3","entryId":"57276","definition":"体育赛事或体育竞赛。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/40d5d5eab8bf0daf7d5a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40855-2-7-2","ko":"공이 빠르게 날아들어서 생각보다 치기가 어렵더라.","zh":"球飞得很快，所以比想象中更难击中呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공이","meaning":"球","explanation":"공：球；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19496","senseId":"1","lemma":"공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공이","audio":"/audio/3d187fca49d07b4aec0f.mp3"}},{"text":"빠르게","meaning":"快，快速","explanation":"빠르다：快，快速；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"빠르다","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68755","senseId":"2","lemma":"빠르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠르게","audio":"/audio/adaf9daf57bb7ab15f4b.mp3"}},{"text":"날아들어서","meaning":"飞过来，飞来","explanation":"날아들다：飞过来，飞来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"날아들다","audio":"/audio/6d5224f45d00d6a1d8c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40855","senseId":"2","lemma":"날아들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날아들어서","audio":"/audio/21cc378c128117d42725.mp3"}},{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각보다","audio":"/audio/60c489add64a605ce212.mp3"}},{"text":"치기가","meaning":"打，玩，抽","explanation":"치다：打，玩，抽；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"4","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치기가","audio":"/audio/3ee9cdd620cf2c054f9a.mp3"}},{"text":"어렵더라.","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렵더라","audio":"/audio/427cda21118fc9e9d3ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"396159745e203d0d","term":"공","zh":"球","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3","entryId":"19496","definition":"用于运动或游戏的圆球形物体，大小适合手玩或脚玩。","pronunciation":["공ː"]},{"id":"904de91feaff572f","term":"빠르다","zh":"快，快速","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3","entryId":"68755","definition":"从一处移动到其它地方所用的时间短。","pronunciation":["빠르다"]},{"id":"6d5224f45d00d6a1","term":"날아들다","zh":"飞过来，飞来","audio":"/audio/6d5224f45d00d6a1d8c0.mp3","entryId":"40855","definition":"迅速地靠过来。","pronunciation":["나라들다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"打，玩，抽","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"用手或手持物品击打物体的游戏或运动。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f9fbde0241e7bd361b79.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.356,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40855","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":123,"sequenceScore":2.0813,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["球飞得很快，所以比想象中更难击中呢。","你说丢失的那枚戒指找到了吗？","棒球游戏好玩吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["球飞得很快，所以比想象中更难击中呢。","棒球游戏好玩吗？","你说丢失的那枚戒指找到了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
